#
# PHONE PROVIDER SETUP - SMS & Voice Calls
#
# This enables direct SMS and voice call notifications.
# Most reliable channel - works even without internet.
#
# ============================================================
# SETUP (5 minutes):
# ============================================================
#
# 1. Create Twilio Account:
#    - Visit: https://www.twilio.com/try-twilio
#    - Sign up (free trial includes $15 credit)
#    - Verify your phone number
#
# 2. Get Credentials:
#    - Go to Console: https://console.twilio.com
#    - Copy Account SID
#    - Copy Auth Token
#    - Get a Twilio phone number (or use trial number)
#
# 3. Configure Above:
#    YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER="+1234567890"      # Your phone (with country code)
#    TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID="ACxxxx..."       # From console
#    TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN="your_token"       # From console
#    TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER="+1234567890"    # Twilio number
#
# 4. Test:
#    python3 autonomous/phone_provider.py --test
#
# ============================================================
# COST (Very Affordable):
# ============================================================
#
# Twilio Pricing:
#   - SMS: $0.0075 per message (~130 messages per $1)
#   - Voice: $0.013 per minute
#   - Free trial: $15 credit (~2000 SMS or 1150 voice minutes)
#
# Typical Usage:
#   - 10 SMS/day = $2.25/month
#   - 2 voice calls/month = $0.03/month
#   - Very affordable for critical alerts
#
# ============================================================
# ALTERNATIVE: AWS SNS
# ============================================================
#
# If you prefer AWS SNS instead of Twilio:
#
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID="your_key"
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY="your_secret"
#
# AWS SNS Pricing:
#   - SMS: $0.00645 per message
#   - Even cheaper than Twilio
#
# ============================================================
# NOTIFICATION ROUTING:
# ============================================================
#
# Once configured, system automatically uses:
#
# Normal Priority → SMS only:
#   - Trade wins
#   - Bounty approved
#   - Email batches
#
# Critical Priority → SMS + Voice Call:
#   - System failures
#   - Process down
#   - Major losses
#   - PR merged (bounty paid)
#
# Voice calls only for TRUE emergencies.
#
# ============================================================
# RATE LIMITING:
# ============================================================
#
# Built-in protection against spam:
#   - SMS: Max 1 per 5 minutes (cooldown)
#   - Voice: Max 1 per 10 minutes
#   - Prevents notification storms
#
# ============================================================
# BENEFITS:
# ============================================================
#
# ✓ Most reliable (works without internet)
# ✓ Instant delivery (faster than apps)
# ✓ Works when phone is locked
# ✓ Native alerts (no app needed)
# ✓ Voice calls for true emergencies
# ✓ SMS works on any phone (even old ones)
#
# ============================================================
#
# After setup, phone provider integrates automatically
# with INTEGRAFIX messaging system.
#
